A list marker inside an item ends a caption like a paragraph

```
- > q
  ^ p
  - b
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <figure>
      <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
      <figcaption>p</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <ul>
      <li>b</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- | a |
  ^ p
  - b
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <table>
      <caption>p</caption>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>a</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <ul>
      <li>b</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- > q
  ^ p
   - b
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <figure>
      <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
      <figcaption>p</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <ul>
      <li>b</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```
